# Match data stays out of the repository.
#
# Coded match files carry real players, real opponents and real scouting
# information. The app and the test suite both read from data/, but nothing in
# there is ours to publish, so the directory is ignored wholesale rather than
# file by file -- a rule that forgets a new extension is how one slips out.
data/
*.vsm
*.dvw
*.vss
*.vsb

# Generated locally from a match file; see data-raw/make_fixture.R
fixture_coords.*

# Charts written out of the app, which embed match data
shotchart*.html
codec_check*.html
*.png

# R
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj

# editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
__pycache__/

# local editor/launch config, carries machine-specific paths
.claude/

# Built by build\make-exe.ps1 from build\scoutR.cs, and the icon it makes
# from the mark the app already serves. The exe itself is committed, so a
# laptop that clones this can double-click it without a build step.
build/scoutR.ico
scoutR.log
